framework.

There is currently **no dedicated spec tree** for the chain layer. The
proposed location is `Spqr/Specs/Chain/`, grounded mathematically by a
proposed `Spqr/Math/Chain/` directory (with auxiliary list/byte lemmas in
[`Spqr/Math/List.lean`](../../Spqr/Math/List.lean)). Existing chain-adjacent
specs live at
[`Spqr/Specs/Proto/PqRatchet/Chain/`](../../Spqr/Specs/Proto/PqRatchet/Chain/)
